; simple_segment.gcode — minimal valid Cura Marlin segment for AA-34 tests
; Machine: Rotrics DexArm with 3D print module
; Generated by: hand-written for AA-34 unit tests
; Units: mm, feedrate mm/min

; --- Start G-code ---
M104 S200 ; Set nozzle temperature (no wait)
M140 S60  ; Set bed temperature (no wait)
G21        ; Set units to millimetres
G90        ; Absolute positioning
M82        ; Absolute extruder mode
G92 E0     ; Reset extruder

; --- First layer ---
G1 Z0.3 F1200       ; Move to first layer height
G1 X10 Y10 F3000    ; Move to start position
G1 X20 Y10 E1.0 F2400 ; Print line
G1 X20 Y20 E2.0 F2400
G1 X10 Y20 E3.0 F2400
G1 X10 Y10 E4.0 F2400

; --- Second layer ---
G1 Z0.6 F1200
G1 X10 Y10 F3000
G1 X20 Y10 E5.0 F2400
G1 X20 Y20 E6.0 F2400

; --- End G-code ---
M104 S0    ; Nozzle off
M140 S0    ; Bed off
M84        ; Disable steppers
